      Avalonia does not. Where only a 20 px drawing exists it is scaled to 16 here, so every
      icon keeps the margin its designer left around it.

      A MenuItem takes one of these as its Icon directly; App.axaml has the data template
      that draws a geometry, in the item's text colour.
